Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:10.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I never knew that liking someone would be this painful. {Wolfy- "Would" hurt this much}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:15.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:25.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Me too...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:32.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun... I like you.{I love you too, Tsuwabuki-kun.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:24.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The truth is, life has gotten complicated since that day. {Wolfy- Become complicated} {Gotten complicated -- Waku}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:31.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:34.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:41.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Aha ha, what happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.59,0:02:46.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,They're at it so early in the morning? {Wolfy- They're at it so early in the morning?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:49.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What a difficult couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:04.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez, making us work so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:08.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey you two, how long has it been now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:12.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Both of them are red like cherries. {she is using a similie,  commenting how their cheeks are red like cherries}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.80,0:03:16.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If it has gone this far, then maybe... {literally translating, the phrase  "they'll be natural monuments" come after the "maybe..." but the  character is commenting how shy those two couples are, or something  like that, but I don't know how to say this in english >.>}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:17.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:42.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}To think that she is Karin-sama's daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:48.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, you sure are full of enthusiasm. {Wolfy- You sure are full of enthusiasm} {Alternatively, "you are surely full of enthusiasm. Either way, a word is missing in here. - Waku}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:58.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to work so hard, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:02.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,As you are an excellent Stellar Spinear, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:15.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ehhh?! You two haven't even been on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:19.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan, you don't want to have a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Of course she wants to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:24.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You want to, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:29.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Uoooh! So irritating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:32.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan, it's time to use this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:35.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,My cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-When did she take that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.29,0:04:40.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you invite him instead, Sumomo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:45.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Me invite him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:49.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:54.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Dinner is served.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:03.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, the sun has already set. {Wolfy- The sun has already set}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:13.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,How about dinner? Maybe taking it in the dining room would be better... {Wolfy- Would be better}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:21.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, that's bad for your health! {Wolfy- That's bad for your health}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:38.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if Tsuwabuki-kun is busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:40.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,He hasn't replied yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:45.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oh crap, I haven't checked my cell phone today. {Wolfy- "checked" my cellphone}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.89,0:05:50.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, there is still time before Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:58.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wonder if you have to hold hands during dates{when you date}.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:07.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Tsuwabuki-kun's hand must be really big.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:11.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}After holding hands, next will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:18.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Next will be getting closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:26.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Stare into Tsuwabuki-kun's eyes while trying not to be nervous. {Wolfy- I think whilst is a better word than while}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:28.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:31.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:41.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:52.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:53.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:56.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:05.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can do it if it's Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:08.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:12.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Safe landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:22.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's from Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:27.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"Let's meet at Hoshinomori Park this coming Sunday at ten."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:28.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see, so that's what it is. {Wolfy- So that's what it is}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:30.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The next mail is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:37.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same mail...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.39,0:07:43.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime must be feeling nervous too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:52.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-Tsuwabuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:55.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:00.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I got lost on the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:04.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,F-First time here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.61,0:08:08.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, but I still got lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:10.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:13.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Errr...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:13.58,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,Errr...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:19.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:19.67,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:54.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This is not good... I need to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:57.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What should I talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:08:59.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Ah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:01.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A-Akihime...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, err... Akihime?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.77,0:09:21.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, look, a swan boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:27.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:35.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.13,0:09:40.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:45.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,H-Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:56.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Guess I'll use it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:03.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wah, it's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:06.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Over there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.99,0:10:11.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:19.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's the Bell of Hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:20.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:33.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When the bell rings while a couple is together...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:34.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.39,0:10:38.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,the couple's future will be connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:44.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-Things like that are kind of embarrassing or...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:49.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,How should I say this... umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:54.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:22.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh it's from Fukamichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:34.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Did you two kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:38.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,L-L-Like I would! {Wolfy- Not sure how this can sound better.. How about "Like I would"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:42.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You went on a date, but didn't do it?{Went for date but didn't do it?} {wolfy- You went for a date but didn't do it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.92,0:11:46.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan, that was your first date right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:49.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Do you kiss on your first date?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:51.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:53.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:56.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-Why are you asking me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.97,0:12:00.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's because Nobuko-san has a lot of experience. {Wolfy- A lot of experience}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:01.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:05.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:08.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You! You did only that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.67,0:12:10.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:11.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:14.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A man should do this and that, all the good things!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:14.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:41.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ahh... I give up...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:45.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we got bombarded with questions all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:47.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:58.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Lately, this place has become the most calming place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:05.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It has sprouted now! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:10.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The seed we planted last time, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:13.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:14.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:15.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:20.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:18.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,First time with this kind of feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:23.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:23.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:29.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow, it's different than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:30.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:34.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know but it feels like something good is going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:37.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.98,0:14:49.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That must be it, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.37,0:14:50.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.05,0:14:54.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I've been waiting for you, Prima Plam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:04.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Aspalas-san... {For the record, I really think the name should be Asparas. Most likely, it decends from a variation on Apsaras, which exist in Hindu mythology as a 'nymph' form of being. Notably, they're known as "The Water Dancers", water spirits that are said to be the best dancers in existence. Coincidence? I think not. - Waku}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:06.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's just Aspalas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:10.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I've given up trying to correct you on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:16.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Prima Plam, tonight will be the time to put each of our Stellar Spinear's pride on the line for a serious match! {fight}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:23.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Aspalas-san... if that is what you wish for...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:26.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:33.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That will be the star drop that we will compete to capture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:38.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This star drop's movement is on another level compared with the others before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:39.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:43.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A high level star drop appeared, just perfect for the match today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:50.99,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Paris Aqua Hominis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.13,0:15:59.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She's walking on the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:03.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Arthur! Are the preparations ready?{Arthur! Is the preparation ready?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.93,0:16:05.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:08.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hear that? Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:12.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do, Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:13.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Watch me, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.88,0:16:15.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.11,0:16:18.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:31.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-What speed it has... alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:35.71,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Ruuche Ruvi Avis!{Ruuche Rubi Avis}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:44.07,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Puruvi Radius!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:58.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:07.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:09.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.89,0:17:16.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She is using Rimu Comiti Aqua, just as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.75,0:17:18.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see if you can catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.85,0:17:33.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see! It's alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:37.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like it's moving fast, but underwater it's moving much slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:41.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And thanks to the Recipe, you can move underwater too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:46.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, if you try hard enough, we can catch it if it's underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:47.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.35,0:17:49.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:56.53,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Puruvu Radi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:01.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:05.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I-It disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.07,0:18:08.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:11.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's the first time I've seen a star drop disappear like that.{First time seeing a star drop disappear like that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:15.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Where is the star drop?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:23.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you catch it in your Ladle, it will just disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:32.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like its speed decreases when it tries to move out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:33.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Can you target it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.62,0:18:34.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:43.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:47.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:48.71,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Paradivu Mei! {whatever used for this flying magic}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:53.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I guess we can only wait till it comes underwater again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.05,0:18:57.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I should have tried flying a little bit further just now. {jumping}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:58.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Flying further?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.87,0:19:02.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\3c&H985443&\shad0\fnLacuna Regular\fs22}Note: "Kyan" in this case is an onomatopoeia similar to "swish" or "woosh" in English.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.87,0:19:02.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We'll try to fly further, "kyan" like that. {hmm suggections} {Yep, just like a flying fish, swish} {English language has horrible choices for onomatopoeia...}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:05.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:09.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I'm filling with energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:14.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan, I think I can do that Recipe Aspalas-san uses too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:15.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just watch, Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:23.15,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Paradivu Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:39.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yay, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:41.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I got wings, wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.10,0:19:43.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan, I'm flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:44.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:46.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, do you feel scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:48.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm alright, I'm not scared at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:50.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:55.51,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Puruvu Radi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:19:59.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You did it, Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:04.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She's flying without using the Ladle...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:11.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's the fourth one, right, Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:12.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:14.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Get a hold of yourself, Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:16.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:19.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Aspalas-san... that is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:21.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A star drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:23.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see. So there were two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.87,0:20:27.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was moving around so fast so it looked like it was only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:28.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.38,0:20:34.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan, that one is much faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.39,0:20:37.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, even though we can fly, that thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:39.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But we need to do something, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:54.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Rimu Forna Mei. A very powerful spell, but making a mistake in using it will be... dangerous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.65,0:20:57.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-What should we do, Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:05.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That girl, suddenly learning new flying magic without practicing...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:09.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And on top of that a type of flying magic using shining wings instead of the Ladle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:12.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I will not give this one to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:14.45,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Puruvi Radiu-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.29,0:21:21.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.66,0:21:27.58,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Rimu Forna Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.39,0:21:31.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This Recipe... It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:33.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You must be kidding! This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.99,0:21:48.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is so mysterious right, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:50.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The star drop is moving much slower now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.65,0:21:55.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:21:58.55,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Puruvu Radi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:21:59.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.99,0:22:01.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's great, Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.70,0:22:09.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This will make it five!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:18.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-This can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:26.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, I feel like I can do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:32.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I feel really really excited, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.88,0:22:33.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.28,0:22:41.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That night was the best thing happening for both me and Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.29,0:22:47.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That's why we never imagined anything really sad occurring after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:22.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A man keeps a secret and keeps on living...{with secrets, a man lives on} {A man lives on carrying secrets} {Wolfy- "A man with secrets keeps on living"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.36,0:24:23.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Keisuke's ten-yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.44,0:24:24.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:26.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Flora-chan's three sizes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.34,0:24:27.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.10,0:24:28.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yayoi's happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.26,0:24:29.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ehhh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.16,0:24:30.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru has one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.55,0:24:32.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like Sumomo is going to know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:34.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do, Haru?
